  m_Text: In this exciting puzzle game, you have to place cube fruits in the correct
    positions according to their color. But it's not that simple! There must be no
    obstacles between the places for the lines to collapse. If the path is blocked,
    the fruit will move to temporary storage, waiting for you to unblock the route
    and select it again. Solve tricky combinations, free the path and clear the field!
